        "node_id": "n_12_91ae4d",
        "thought_text": "Verify the greedy strategy by induction: if the current largest card is taken, the remaining subgame is identical in structure but with fewer cards, so the optimal play continues to be picking the largest available card at each step.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4322830900822156335",
